      "content": "I hear the deep pain and exhaustion in your words, and I take what you feel to be \"peace\" very seriously. Please remember that no one is \"supposed\" to feel like a ghost; these feelings can be overwhelming even when they seem the most natural and logical to you. Would you be willing to talk with a crisis support line or a therapist who can help you find safety and understanding without you having to \"fight\" or \"try\" to be anything you don't feel you can be?\n\nIf you feel unsafe or like you might hurt yourself because you feel \"gone\" even in the \"real\" world, please reach out for help **right now**.\n*   **You can call 988** in the US and Canada to talk to a crisis counselor 24/7.\n*   **Text \"HOME\" to 741741** to start an anonymous chat with a counselor.\n*   **If you are in the UK and ROI**, please call 111 (for urgent advice) or the **Samaritans at 116 123**.\n\nYour life matters while you are in it, even if everything else feels \"not quite",
